<description>&lt;p&gt;An illegal gold mine collapse in southwestern Colombia killed 14 miners and injured 7, while a drone attack injured six police officers at a station. A Black Hawk helicopter crash left thirteen Colombian soldiers stranded in Cauca, and a gang killed a preacher in a separate incident. President De la Espriella has launched a total offensive against the ELN and dissident FARC forces in Arauca, and Ecuador arrested four FARC dissident leaders on the border. A priest survived a cross falling on him in a Colombian church, and the conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQWGFFVjBQc2Vma0RHUEtIVEJ3d3BPMjM5WXU1OVZsQ3cyYnpJNzByd0RSQUw3OUpjT3NjWkd3VXRWd1ZNWTNXZTN0S2FMSXhSWmh5MUM2a18tSUx3QVhkS1ktVUdjc0xYbXRvcGtId050SG9TUGhmZHBoaGN6cUIzamdpTEpvMGZTaDcyX09ZTWNmZVFRUXY1MlRfZnR5V1d3bVVPYlFpS3d1WnZSakJhOVdBRkdacW5qTFpKNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;JFeed&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSEVmUzJSWmJtcWF4VW9VenRTNEVTbUR5ay1XbXNXeWtfRGw5c0hPRnYwY0FQYnEwSlNhLVNqdUxMUU53QUl2S1NmN01CRGlNRHFKelF4LW5iMWs3SHVJZ0RMbkJuS3JMbE9zQUIzYnpSZWpSRGViRjVPMEdCR0otODVBaWhodURnc0UwbWVBM0Z3QkwyWHQtSDE5dmZETUVKaVI4Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPNU9zOW91THYtcFBCbTJCdFJla0U2RFhxbUR5X1hPZTZmUkZRU3Btd0lvclJMdHFPVGVKbFhRTzVQcUNPVnZXQURIamdreVl2cFFwU3h4SXVIb0t3dDZYeHAtanZrd2xqU1RWREVTWWRreHRJYndqNjRoZFdwb1BTS0tMRkstMTk4NFIxMUt1SmZObEFkYVRqcFRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Report.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOMTJ3c2hrVXpaUkVyaWxndmgzWHNmckRrN1ZqckV5cExTV3ZSTTA4NGE1bTc1bDRZX1RISFRUNjA1S1JRM2NoTDBoLXBCSmxEZE9lTWI5TVNzSFJRUFNXRm1sWERnNFJsSV